
📘 Madhuram – ITR (Inspection Test Request) API Documentation
Overview
The ITR API in Madhuram manages Inspection Test Requests for projects.
It supports:
Uploading ITR attachments/files
Creating ITR records with structured JSON sections
Fetching ITRs by project
Getting ITR by ID
Updating ITR
Deleting ITR
✅ Base URL: /api/itr
✅ Upload Directory: /uploads/itr
✅ Database Table: itrs
✅ Storage Format: Most sections are stored as JSON strings in PostgreSQL.

📦 ITR Data Structure (Stored in DB)
An ITR contains multiple structured sections:
header_details (object)
contractor_details (object)
mep_clearance (object)
surveyor_clearance (object)
interface_clearance (object)
contract_manager (object)
pmc_comments (string)
engineer_civil (object)
engineer_mep (object)
tower_incharge (object)
qaa_department (object)
result_code (string)

