🔎 4) Get ITR by ID
GET /api/itr/{id}
Fetches a single ITR record using itr_id.
Path Parameter
Param
Type
id
integer

Success Response (200)
{
  "itr_id": 10,
  "project_id": 1,
  "header_details": { "project_name": "Madhuram Tower A" }
}

Error Response (404)
{ "error": "ITR not found" }



✏️ 5) Update an Existing ITR
PUT /api/itr/{id}
Updates an ITR record.
Only provided fields will be updated; missing ones remain unchanged (via COALESCE).
✅ updated_at is always set automatically.
Request Type
application/json
Updatable Fields
header_details
contractor_details
mep_clearance
surveyor_clearance
interface_clearance
contract_manager
pmc_comments
engineer_civil
engineer_mep
tower_incharge
qaa_department
result_code
Example Request
{
  "pmc_comments": "Approved after re-check",
  "result_code": "APPROVED",
  "engineer_civil": {
    "name": "Civil Engineer A",
    "signature": "Signed",
    "date": "2026-02-03"
  }
}

Success Response (200)
Returns the updated ITR row.
Error Response (404)
{ "error": "ITR not found" }


🗑️ 6) Delete an ITR
DELETE /api/itr/{id}
